  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "塩味が　ある　食材。薄く切った　シート状のチーズ。扱いやすく　サンドウィッチの　具材向き。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "짠맛이 나는 식재료. 얇게 저민 시트형 치즈다. 다루기 쉬워서 샌드위치 재료로 적합하다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "帶有鹹味的食材。切成薄片的起司。容易使用，適合作為三明治的材料。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un ingrédient au goût salé. Ce fromage a été coupé en tranches fines pour le rendre encore plus facile à ajouter à un Sandwich.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Diese in dünne Scheiben geschnittene salzige Zutat ist der perfekte Belag für ein Sandwich.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "De fuerte sabor salado, esta fina loncha de queso está pensada para poder incluirse fácilmente en cualquier bocadillo.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un ingrediente salato. Tagliato a fette sottili è ideale da usare nei panini.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A very salty ingredient. This thinly sliced cheese is perfect for adding to a sandwich.",
